<xi:include parse="text" href="samplecode/src/main/kotlin/AdjListGraph.kt" />
^^^^
<xi:include parse="text" href="samplecode/src/main/kotlin/AdjacencyListGraphTest.kt" />

      </code>
    </program>
  </listing>
  <p>Here is its output:</p>
  <pre>
Test 1: directed graph
0: {1=5.0, 5=2.0}
1: {2=4.0}
2: {3=9.0}
3: {4=7.0, 5=3.0}
4: {0=1.0}
5: {4=8.0, 2=1.0}

Test 2: undirected graph
0: {1=5.0, 5=2.0, 4=1.0}
1: {0=5.0, 2=4.0}
2: {1=4.0, 3=9.0, 5=1.0}
3: {2=9.0, 4=7.0, 5=3.0}
4: {3=7.0, 0=1.0, 5=8.0}
5: {0=2.0, 3=3.0, 4=8.0, 2=1.0}
    </pre>
</section>
